-- whose leading letters are the clothing family for 98%% of vanilla armour, so
-- a modder who named their row conventionally gets a real slot - and with it
-- the layer order and the gambeson-under-plate rule, without which plate is
-- silently refused. A miss just means slot unknown, which is still wearable.
